 Over 300 weapons</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rainbow Herbicides</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the horrors of deforestation chemicals like “Agent Orange” in co-op and single-player action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• 6-player online co-op <br>• 16 unique zombie types <br>• Construct barricades <br>• Deployable turrets <br>• Shop with 300+ weapons</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >NO MICROTRANSACTIONS. ALL FUTURE CONTENT IS FREE.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EARLY ACCESS – PERFORMANCE, GRAPHICS &amp; CONTENT ARE SUBJECT TO CHANGE.</h2>", "short_description": "It’s 1968 in Vietnam, the time to “Make War Not Love”. Side with the Viet Cong or U.S. Army in this intense, fast-paced FPS set in the Vietnam War — now with co-op zombie mode. Choose from 300+ weapons of destruction. Kill or be killed!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese, Polish, Spanish - Spain, Traditional Chinese, Russian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1012110/8f27b3db11a8877b9ca04945989e5e72aceb4720/header.jpg?t=1786512720", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1012110/67ae21f0bdb39434cb0c23398b15c635610b6b4e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786512720", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1012110/67ae21f0bdb39434cb0c23398b15c635610b6b4e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786512720", "website": "https://militaryconflictvietnam.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows® 10 / 11 (64bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-4440 (3.10GHz) / AMD FX-6300 (3.50GHz)<br></li>